  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Talimbika Sunflower Oil Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Sunflower oil.Town/City: Salima District, Malawi.Summary: This expansion grant will focus on equipping Talimbika Agro-Processing and Marketing Co-operative Society with adequate seed oil processing equipment to produce quality cooking oil, while continuing to build the organization&apos;s capacities in financial and operations management. Talimbika provides its membership with access to necessary inputs for growing sunflowers and purchases seeds from members. During this grant, Talimbika will expand and professionalize its processing facility; take its members on an exchange visit; undergo trainings in business management, modern farming, and marketing, among other topics; purchase a motorcycle; and install a solar-powered water pump.</narrative>
  </description>
